	 *    File Header
	 *    obj m (Linearization params)
	 *    xref #1 (refers to objects m-n)
	 *    obj m+1
	 *    ...
	 *    obj n
	 *    obj 1
	 *    ...
	 *    obj n-1
	 *    xref #2
	 *
